 ['Baseline FBC, renal/liver profile and chestX-ray. FBC and renal/liver profiles before each cycle; review counts and treatment suitability on scheduled treatment days under the treating plan.','Monitor mucositis, neuropathy, constipation/ileus, infection, new cough or breathlessness and third-space fluid collections.','Use the low-dose MTX product pathway: this30mg/m² regimen does not justify importing high-dose MTX rescue/hydration schedules. Review interactions and renal function carefully.'],
